# 水库调度预案智能生成 Skill v2.1

## 数据库

```bash
mysql -h 127.0.0.1 -P 3306 -u root -p123456aA. powerelf_srm_yml
```

**核心表**: st_rsvr_r(水情), att_res_flse_lim(汛限), model_config(配置), model_result_files(历史预案), srm_flood_history_base(历史洪水)

## 快速查询（推荐使用脚本，一次获取所有数据）

```bash
# 推荐：一次获取所有需要的数据（减少查询次数，避免超时）
python3 scripts/query_plan_data.py --type full_context

# 或单独查询：
python3 scripts/query_plan_data.py --type current_water_level
python3 scripts/query_plan_data.py --type rainfall_forecast --hours 48
python3 scripts/query_plan_data.py --type weather_warning
python3 scripts/query_plan_data.py --type flood_limit
python3 scripts/query_plan_data.py --type config
python3 scripts/query_plan_data.py --type historical_plans --limit 10
python3 scripts/query_plan_data.py --type historical_floods --limit 10
```

**效率提示**：优先使用 `--type full_context` 一次获取所有数据，避免多次查询导致超时。

## 直接SQL查询

```sql
-- 当前水位
SELECT rz, inq, otq, tm FROM st_rsvr_r WHERE deleted = 0 AND rz IS NOT NULL ORDER BY tm DESC LIMIT 1;

-- 汛限水位（当前日期匹配）
SELECT flse_lim_stag, flood_season_name FROM att_res_flse_lim
WHERE flood_season_start <= DATE_FORMAT(NOW(), '%m%d') AND flood_season_end >= DATE_FORMAT(NOW(), '%m%d') LIMIT 1;

-- 非汛期时从 att_res_base 查询
SELECT fl_low_lim_lev FROM att_res_base WHERE fl_low_lim_lev IS NOT NULL LIMIT 1;

-- 系统配置
SELECT config_key, value FROM model_config WHERE config_key IN ('max_water_level','min_water_level','max_drainage_capacity','safe_drainage_capacity') AND deleted = 0;

-- 降雨预报
SELECT ymdh, rn, text FROM f_rnfl_h WHERE deleted = 0 AND ymdh >= NOW() ORDER BY ymdh LIMIT 48;

-- 气象预警
SELECT docid, docabstract, docpubtime FROM weather_warn WHERE warn_status = '1' ORDER BY docpubtime DESC LIMIT 5;

-- 历史预案
SELECT id, alias, target_water_level, adjusted_water_level, start_time, end_time, extend FROM model_result_files WHERE type = 2 ORDER BY create_time DESC LIMIT 10;

-- 历史洪水
SELECT id, name, start_time, end_time, adjusted_water_level, target_water_level, status, remake FROM srm_flood_history_base WHERE deleted = 0 ORDER BY create_time DESC LIMIT 10;

-- 水位-库容曲线
SELECT stag, cap FROM att_res_stag_cap_disc ORDER BY stag;

-- 泄流曲线
SELECT stag, q FROM att_res_discharge_curve ORDER BY stag;
```

